flowchart TD
  A[Whole-slide images] --> B[ROI and patch extraction]
  B --> C[Tissue filtering]
  C --> D[Normalization and augmentation]
  D --> E[Color and texture features]
  E --> F[Standardization and balancing]
  F --> RF[Random Forest]
  F --> LR[Logistic Regression]
  F --> SVM[Support Vector Machine]
  RF & LR & SVM --> V[Soft-voted probabilities]
  V --> U{High uncertainty?}
  U -->|Yes| R[Unknown or manual review]
  U -->|No| P[HER2 class and confidence]
  P --> X[Grad-CAM explanation]
